{
  "group_title": "C Gaussian 波包、移动与展宽",
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "c01-carrier-envelope-spectrum",
      "title": "载波、包络与频谱",
      "caption": "两种归一化Gaussian初态只有载波不同：q0=(0,0)和(0.7,0)，sigma=4。左图的x边际概率严格相同；中图画中心区域连续展开的载波相位q0x*x，省略低振幅尾部；右图为单位正交FFT所得离散频谱的x边际概率，所有波矢的总概率为1。载波改变频谱中心及后续传播，但不改变初始概率包络。",
      "group": "c-gaussian",
      "role": "core",
      "parameters": {
        "N": 256,
        "boundary": "periodic; verified against N=384",
        "tau_max": 60,
        "S": 0.5,
        "h": 0.0,
        "units": {
          "position": "a",
          "time": "hbar/Jx",
          "momentum": "1/a"
        },
        "gaussian_convention": "psi0 ~ exp[-x^2/(4 sigma^2)-y^2/(4 sigma^2)] exp(i q0.r); sum |psi|^2=1",
        "cases": [
          {
            "name": "qzero",
            "sigma": 4.0,
            "q0": [
              0.0,
              0.0
            ],
            "eta": 1.0
          },
          {
            "name": "qright",
            "sigma": 4.0,
            "q0": [
              0.7,
              0.0
            ],
            "eta": 1.0
          }
        ]
      },
      "files": {
        "png": "c-gaussian/c01-carrier-envelope-spectrum.png",
        "svg": "c-gaussian/c01-carrier-envelope-spectrum.svg",
        "pdf": "c-gaussian/c01-carrier-envelope-spectrum.pdf"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-space-bandwidth",
      "title": "空间宽度与频谱宽度",
      "caption": "比较sigma=3、6、10的无啁啾Gaussian初态，q0=(0.7,0)。sigma是概率分布的RMS宽度；不是振幅指数中再平方后的宽度。所有初态总概率为1，所以窄初态的空间峰值更高，而宽初态的频谱更窄。本图横轴和纵轴在各参数曲线之间统一。Delta q=1/(2 sigma)是宽包络、频谱远离Brillouin区接缝时的连续Gaussian表达式。",
      "group": "c-gaussian",
      "role": "core",
      "parameters": {
        "N": 256,
        "boundary": "periodic; verified against N=384",
        "tau_max": 60,
        "S": 0.5,
        "h": 0.0,
        "units": {
          "position": "a",
          "time": "hbar/Jx",
          "momentum": "1/a"
        },
        "gaussian_convention": "psi0 ~ exp[-x^2/(4 sigma^2)-y^2/(4 sigma^2)] exp(i q0.r); sum |psi|^2=1",
        "cases": [
          {
            "name": "sigma3",
            "sigma": 3.0,
            "q0": [
              0.7,
              0.0
            ],
            "eta": 1.0
          },
          {
            "name": "sigma6",
            "sigma": 6.0,
            "q0": [
              0.7,
              0.0
            ],
            "eta": 1.0
          },
          {
            "name": "sigma10",
            "sigma": 10.0,
            "q0": [
              0.7,
              0.0
            ],
            "eta": 1.0
          }
        ]
      },
      "files": {
        "png": "c-gaussian/c02-space-bandwidth.png",
        "svg": "c-gaussian/c02-space-bandwidth.svg",
        "pdf": "c-gaussian/c02-space-bandwidth.pdf"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-zero-carrier-spreading",
      "title": "零中心波矢：质心停留，概率向外展开",
      "caption": "精确余弦色散下，sigma=4、q0=(0.0, 0.0)的归一化Gaussian在tau=0、30、60的二维格点概率。三个面板采用相同位置坐标范围和固定线性色标。青色虚线标记由概率分布直接计算的质心，标注给出概率RMS宽度。谱分布关于零波矢对称，因此两个方向的平均群速度都为0，质心停留在原点；不同非零波矢成分仍会向外传播并引起展宽。",
      "group": "c-gaussian",
      "role": "core",
      "parameters": {
        "N": 256,
        "boundary": "periodic; verified against N=384",
        "tau_max": 60,
        "S": 0.5,
        "h": 0.0,
        "units": {
          "position": "a",
          "time": "hbar/Jx",
          "momentum": "1/a"
        },
        "gaussian_convention": "psi0 ~ exp[-x^2/(4 sigma^2)-y^2/(4 sigma^2)] exp(i q0.r); sum |psi|^2=1",
        "cases": [
          {
            "name": "qzero",
            "sigma": 4.0,
            "q0": [
              0.0,
              0.0
            ],
            "eta": 1.0
          }
        ]
      },
      "files": {
        "png": "c-gaussian/c03-zero-carrier-spreading.png",
        "svg": "c-gaussian/c03-zero-carrier-spreading.svg",
        "pdf": "c-gaussian/c03-zero-carrier-spreading.pdf"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-moving-gaussian",
      "title": "非零中心波矢：向右移动，同时逐渐展宽",
      "caption": "精确余弦色散下，sigma=4、q0=(0.7, 0.0)的归一化Gaussian在tau=0、30、60的二维格点概率。三个面板采用相同位置坐标范围和固定线性色标。青色虚线标记由概率分布直接计算的质心，标注给出概率RMS宽度。频谱中心向正qx偏移，带来正x方向平均群速度；有限频宽仍使各成分群速度不同，所以包络一边移动一边展宽。y方向中心波矢为0，平均位移为0，但仍会展宽。",
      "group": "c-gaussian",
      "role": "core",
      "parameters": {
        "N": 256,
        "boundary": "periodic; verified against N=384",
        "tau_max": 60,
        "S": 0.5,
        "h": 0.0,
        "units": {
          "position": "a",
          "time": "hbar/Jx",
          "momentum": "1/a"
        },
        "gaussian_convention": "psi0 ~ exp[-x^2/(4 sigma^2)-y^2/(4 sigma^2)] exp(i q0.r); sum |psi|^2=1",
        "cases": [
          {
            "name": "qright",
            "sigma": 4.0,
            "q0": [
              0.7,
              0.0
            ],
            "eta": 1.0
          }
        ]
      },
      "files": {
        "png": "c-gaussian/c04-moving-gaussian.png",
        "svg": "c-gaussian/c04-moving-gaussian.svg",
        "pdf": "c-gaussian/c04-moving-gaussian.pdf"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-carrier-directions",
      "title": "由载波控制传播方向",
      "caption": "保持sigma=4和初始概率包络相同，只将载波改成(-0.7,0)、(0.7,0)、(0.7,0.7)。在tau=60时分别得到左行、右行和斜向传播。白箭头由原点指向谱平均速度乘以时间得到的质心预测。对当前等宽、各向同性交换且两个非零波矢分量相同的例子，斜向群速度方向与载波方向一致；这一一致性并非任意色散或各向异性情形下的普遍规律。",
      "group": "c-gaussian",
      "role": "core",
      "parameters": {
        "N": 256,
        "boundary": "periodic; verified against N=384",
        "tau_max": 60,
        "S": 0.5,
        "h": 0.0,
        "units": {
          "position": "a",
          "time": "hbar/Jx",
          "momentum": "1/a"
        },
        "gaussian_convention": "psi0 ~ exp[-x^2/(4 sigma^2)-y^2/(4 sigma^2)] exp(i q0.r); sum |psi|^2=1",
        "cases": [
          {
            "name": "qleft",
            "sigma": 4.0,
            "q0": [
              -0.7,
              0.0
            ],
            "eta": 1.0
          },
          {
            "name": "qright",
            "sigma": 4.0,
            "q0": [
              0.7,
              0.0
            ],
            "eta": 1.0
          },
          {
            "name": "qdiagonal",
            "sigma": 4.0,
            "q0": [
              0.7,
              0.7
            ],
            "eta": 1.0
          }
        ]
      },
      "files": {
        "png": "c-gaussian/c05-carrier-directions.png",
        "svg": "c-gaussian/c05-carrier-directions.svg",
        "pdf": "c-gaussian/c05-carrier-directions.pdf"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-centroid-velocity",
      "title": "质心运动与谱平均速度",
      "caption": "四种载波的概率质心由精确FFT演化计算。圆点为数值结果，实线用初态全频谱的<sin qx>和eta<sin qy>预测，虚线用中心波矢处的(sin q0x,eta sin q0y)近似。对于sigma=4，有限频宽使两者存在虽小但真实的差异，不能把中心值近似称为精确质心速度。当前无边界污染的平移不变模型中，位置期望按谱平均速度作直线运动。",
      "group": "c-gaussian",
      "role": "core",
      "parameters": {
        "N": 256,
        "boundary": "periodic; verified against N=384",
        "tau_max": 60,
        "S": 0.5,
        "h": 0.0,
        "units": {
          "position": "a",
          "time": "hbar/Jx",
          "momentum": "1/a"
        },
        "gaussian_convention": "psi0 ~ exp[-x^2/(4 sigma^2)-y^2/(4 sigma^2)] exp(i q0.r); sum |psi|^2=1",
        "cases": [
          {
            "name": "qzero",
            "sigma": 4.0,
            "q0": [
              0.0,
              0.0
            ],
            "eta": 1.0
          },
          {
            "name": "qright",
            "sigma": 4.0,
            "q0": [
              0.7,
              0.0
            ],
            "eta": 1.0
          },
          {
            "name": "qleft",
            "sigma": 4.0,
            "q0": [
              -0.7,
              0.0
            ],
            "eta": 1.0
          },
          {
            "name": "qdiagonal",
            "sigma": 4.0,
            "q0": [
              0.7,
              0.7
            ],
            "eta": 1.0
          }
        ]
      },
      "files": {
        "png": "c-gaussian/c06-centroid-velocity.png",
        "svg": "c-gaussian/c06-centroid-velocity.svg",
        "pdf": "c-gaussian/c06-centroid-velocity.pdf"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-comoving-marginals",
      "title": "共动坐标下的包络展宽",
      "caption": "对q0=(0.7,0)、sigma=4的同一个波包，画tau=0、20、40、60的x和y边际概率。仅在横轴减去数值质心，没有重新归一化峰值或宽度。曲线使用实际格点概率并连线。x、y方向的色散曲率不同，因而展宽程度不同；质心的直线移动与包络的形状变化是可以分别测量的两件事。",
      "group": "c-gaussian",
      "role": "core",
      "parameters": {
        "N": 256,
        "boundary": "periodic; verified against N=384",
        "tau_max": 60,
        "S": 0.5,
        "h": 0.0,
        "units": {
          "position": "a",
