    {
      "id": "c09-rms-exact-moments",
      "title": "概率宽度与精确速度方差",
      "caption": "对于初始实Gaussian包络乘线性载波，初始位置与速度的对称协方差为零，因此无限晶格上Var(n_mu(tau))=Var(n_mu(0))+tau^2 Var(v_mu)精确成立。一般有啁啾的初态还会有2*tau*Cov_sym(n_mu,v_mu)项，不能直接套用本图公式。图中实线完全由初态离散频谱平均计算，圆点来自精确余弦色散演化；有限周期盒在tau<=60内已检查边缘概率与扩大网格误差。",
      "group": "c-gaussian",
      "role": "core",
      "parameters": {
        "N": 256,
        "boundary": "periodic; verified against N=384",
        "tau_max": 60,
        "S": 0.5,
        "h": 0.0,
        "units": {
          "position": "a",
          "time": "hbar/Jx",
          "momentum": "1/a"
        },
        "gaussian_convention": "psi0 ~ exp[-x^2/(4 sigma^2)-y^2/(4 sigma^2)] exp(i q0.r); sum |psi|^2=1",
        "cases": [
          {
            "name": "qzero",
            "sigma": 4.0,
            "q0": [
              0.0,
              0.0
            ],
            "eta": 1.0
          },
          {
            "name": "qright",
            "sigma": 4.0,
            "q0": [
              0.7,
              0.0
            ],
            "eta": 1.0
          },
          {
            "name": "qdiagonal",
            "sigma": 4.0,
            "q0": [
              0.7,
              0.7
            ],
            "eta": 1.0
          }
        ]
      },
      "files": {
        "png": "c-gaussian/c09-rms-exact-moments.png",
        "svg": "c-gaussian/c09-rms-exact-moments.svg",
        "pdf": "c-gaussian/c09-rms-exact-moments.pdf"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c10-anisotropy-direction",
      "title": "各向异性下波矢与传播方向",
      "caption": "固定q0=(0.7,0.7)、sigma=4和tau=60，仅改变eta=Jy/Jx为1或0.3。青色虚箭头示意波矢方向，长度不代表物理速度；白色箭头表示实际质心位移。两个初态的波矢方向同为45度，谱平均群速度方向分别约为45度和16.7度。由于vy=eta sin qy，较弱的y方向交换降低了y方向传播速率。所有概率图用同一固定线性色标。",
      "group": "c-gaussian",
      "role": "core",
      "parameters": {
        "N": 256,
        "boundary": "periodic; verified against N=384",
        "tau_max": 60,
        "S": 0.5,
        "h": 0.0,
        "units": {
          "position": "a",
          "time": "hbar/Jx",
          "momentum": "1/a"
        },
        "gaussian_convention": "psi0 ~ exp[-x^2/(4 sigma^2)-y^2/(4 sigma^2)] exp(i q0.r); sum |psi|^2=1",
        "cases": [
          {
            "name": "qdiagonal",
            "sigma": 4.0,
            "q0": [
              0.7,
              0.7
            ],
            "eta": 1.0
